        <div class="text-box">
            <p><b>Welcome to EQ2</b></p>
            <p>
                we believe technology has the power to transform lives—but only when driven by empathy.
            </p>
            <p>
                As a technical consulting firm, we’re passionate about solving complex problems and delivering
                cutting-edge solutions,
                all while staying grounded in our commitment to humanity.</p>
                <p>
                    <b>Who We Are</b>
                </p>
                <p>
                    At EQ2, people come first. Whether we’re working with clients to build smarter systems,
                    or with communities to address urgent needs,
                    our mission is to make a difference through both our work and our values.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <b>What We Do</b>
                </p>
                <p>
                    We provide tailored technical consulting services to help organizations achieve their goals.
                </p>
